{"id":"fujii-vs-kyusen","order":1170,"title":{"ja":"藤井システム対居飛車急戦：▲７四歩から大駒を捌く","en":"Fujii System vs Static Rook quick attack: ▲7四歩 and settling the major pieces"},"path":["戦法・定跡","藤井システム"],"intro":{"ja":"藤井システムは持久戦を狙う戦法ですが、相手は基本形を見て急戦に切り替えてくることがあります。急戦では居玉のままでは戦えません。８筋と７筋の歩を伸ばされたら玉を囲いの中へ入れ、△７五歩からの銀の攻めには▲７四歩と取られそうな歩を伸ばし、▲６五歩から大駒を捌いて美濃囲いの堅さを活かします。","en":"The Fujii System aims at long games, but the opponent may switch to a quick attack after seeing the basic form. Against a quick attack the king cannot stay at home. When the eighth and seventh file pawns are pushed, the king goes into the castle; against the silver attack after △7五歩 Sente pushes the threatened pawn with ▲7四歩, then settles the major pieces with ▲6五歩 and makes use of the firm Mino castle."},"check":{"question":{"ja":"△７五歩▲同歩△６四銀と出られたとき、取られそうな７筋の歩をどうしますか。","en":"After △7五歩 ▲同歩 △6四銀, what does Sente do with the threatened seventh-file pawn?"},"answer":{"ja":"▲７四歩と、歩を伸ばします。取られそうな歩を前へ突き出すのが振り飛車の手筋で、そのあと▲６五歩と角道を開けて大駒を捌いていきます。","en":"Extend it with ▲7四歩. Pushing a threatened pawn forward is a standard technique for Ranging Rook, and Sente then opens the bishop line with ▲6五歩 and settles the major pieces."}},"source":"この講座のために書き下ろした解説と局面です。\n参考: 藤井システムvs居飛車急戦の定跡 (https://shogi-joutatsu.com/archives/7513, All rights reserved)","references":[{"title":"藤井システムvs居飛車急戦の定跡","url":"https://shogi-joutatsu.com/archives/7513","license":"All rights reserved","adapted":false}],"courses":[{"id":"lesson-fujii-vs-kyusen-1","title":"藤井システム対居飛車急戦：▲７四歩から大駒を捌く: 急戦の構えを見たら玉を囲う","titleEn":"Fujii System vs Static Rook quick attack: ▲7四歩 and settling the major pieces: Castle the king when a quick attack appears","myStrategy":"lesson","opponentStrategy":"lesson","mySide":"sente","userSide":"sente","noEngine":true,"source":"この講座のために書き下ろした解説と局面です。\n参考: 藤井システムvs居飛車急戦の定跡 (https://shogi-joutatsu.com/archives/7513, All rights reserved)","goalFormation":"後手が８筋と７筋の歩を突き出し、居飛車の速攻の気配が出ました。居玉のままでは受けきれないので、▲４八玉から▲３九玉と玉を囲いへ入れます。急戦のときの玉は２八が最良ですが、届かなくても、できるだけ奥にしまっておきます。","root":{"id":"n0","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/9/PPPPPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7g7f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n1","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"3c3d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n2","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/pppppp1pp/6p2/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6g6f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n3","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/pppppp1pp/6p2/9/2PP5/PP2PPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8c8d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n4","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1pppp1pp/1p4p2/9/2PP5/PP2PPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"2h6h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n5","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1pppp1pp/1p4p2/9/2PP5/PP2PPPPP/1B1R5/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7a6b","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n6","sfen":"ln1gkgsnl/1r1s3b1/p1pppp1pp/1p4p2/9/2PP5/PP2PPPPP/1B1R5/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"1g1f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n7","sfen":"ln1gkgsnl/1r1s3b1/p1pppp1pp/1p4p2/9/2PP4P/PP2PPPP1/1B1R5/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"5a4b","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n8","sfen":"ln1g1gsnl/1r1s1k1b1/p1pppp1pp/1p4p2/9/2PP4P/PP2PPPP1/1B1R5/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8h7g","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n9","sfen":"ln1g1gsnl/1r1s1k1b1/p1pppp1pp/1p4p2/9/2PP4P/PPB1PPPP1/3R5/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"4b3b","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n10","sfen":"ln1g1gsnl/1r1s2kb1/p1pppp1pp/1p4p2/9/2PP4P/PPB1PPPP1/3R5/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"3i3h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n11","sfen":"ln1g1gsnl/1r1s2kb1/p1pppp1pp/1p4p2/9/2PP4P/PPB1PPPP1/3R2S2/LNSGKG1NL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6a5b","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n12","sfen":"ln3gsnl/1r1sg1kb1/p1pppp1pp/1p4p2/9/2PP4P/PPB1PPPP1/3R2S2/LNSGKG1NL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6i5h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n13","sfen":"ln3gsnl/1r1sg1kb1/p1pppp1pp/1p4p2/9/2PP4P/PPB1PPPP1/3RG1S2/LNS1KG1NL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"5c5d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n14","sfen":