":"ln3gsnl/1r2g1kb1/p2p1p1pp/3sp1p2/1pP6/3P1P2P/PPB1P1PP1/2SRG1S2/LN3GKNL b P 1","branches":[{"usi":"7e7d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n47","sfen":"ln3gsnl/1r2g1kb1/p2p1p1pp/2Psp1p2/1p7/3P1P2P/PPB1P1PP1/2SRG1S2/LN3GKNL w P 1","branches":[{"usi":"6d5e","kind":"deviation","child":{"id":"n48","sfen":"ln3gsnl/1r2g1kb1/p2p1p1pp/2P1p1p2/1p2s4/3P1P2P/PPB1P1PP1/2SRG1S2/LN3GKNL b P 1","branches":[{"usi":"6f6e","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n49","sfen":"ln3gsnl/1r2g1kb1/p2p1p1pp/2P1p1p2/1p1Ps4/5P2P/PPB1P1PP1/2SRG1S2/LN3GKNL w P 1","branches":[{"usi":"1c1d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n50","sfen":"ln3gsnl/1r2g1kb1/p2p1p1p1/2P1p1p1p/1p1Ps4/5P2P/PPB1P1PP1/2SRG1S2/LN3GKNL b P 1","branches":[{"usi":"7d7c+","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n51","sfen":"ln3gsnl/1r2g1kb1/p1+Pp1p1p1/4p1p1p/1p1Ps4/5P2P/PPB1P1PP1/2SRG1S2/LN3GKNL w P 1","branches":[{"usi":"8a7c","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n52","sfen":"l4gsnl/1r2g1kb1/p1np1p1p1/4p1p1p/1p1Ps4/5P2P/PPB1P1PP1/2SRG1S2/LN3GKNL b Pp 1","branches":[{"usi":"P*7d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n53","sfen":"l4gsnl/1r2g1kb1/p1np1p1p1/2P1p1p1p/1p1Ps4/5P2P/PPB1P1PP1/2SRG1S2/LN3GKNL w p 1","branches":[],"comment":"▲７四歩の打ちが桂取りです。７三の桂に当たり、後手はこの桂を守れず、先手がよくなります。△８四飛の意味は、こうした筋を消すことにあります。","commentEn":"The drop ▲7四歩 attacks the knight on 7c. Gote cannot protect it and Sente is better. The point of △8四飛 is to remove such lines.","figures":[{"id":"2-v1-1","marks":{"last":"7d","arrows":["7d7c"]}}]}}],"comment":"後手が△８四飛と浮かず、別の手を指した場合を見ます。このときも▲６五歩と角道を開けるのが良く、続いて▲７三歩成と捨て、△同桂に▲７四歩と打つのが桂取りになって厳しい攻めです。","commentEn":"Consider the case where Gote does not float the rook with △8四飛 and plays elsewhere. Opening the bishop line with ▲6五歩 is again good, followed by the sacrifice ▲7三歩成 and, after △同桂, ▲7四歩, a severe attack on the knight.","figures":[{"id":"2-v1"}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"▲７四歩と、取られそうな７筋の歩を前へ突き出します。ねらわれた歩を伸ばして逃がすのは、振り飛車の定番の手筋です。これで７五の歩が銀に取られる心配がなくなり、先手は相手の攻めを利用した反撃に移れます。","commentEn":"▲7四歩 pushes the threatened seventh-file pawn forward. Escaping a targeted pawn by advancing it is a standard Ranging Rook technique. The pawn can no longer be taken by the silver on 7e, and Sente can move on to a counterattack that uses Gote's own attack.","figures":[{"id":"2-3","marks":{"last":"7d","boxes":["7d","7e"]}}]}}],"comment":"後手は△７五歩と突き捨て、▲同歩に△６四銀と銀を繰り出しました。居飛車が先手なら▲４六銀と出る形で、右銀急戦と呼ばれる仕掛けです。次に△７五銀と進んで、歩を取りながら攻めるのが狙いです。","commentEn":"Gote sacrifices a pawn with △7五歩 and after ▲同歩 brings the silver out with △6四銀. With colours reversed this would be ▲4六銀, and the attack is called the right-silver quick attack. Next Gote aims for △7五銀, taking the pawn while attacking.","figures":[{"id":"2-2","marks":{"last":"6d","arrows":["6d7e"]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"前の章の局面です。後手が７筋から仕掛ける順を見ます。","commentEn":"The position from the previous chapter. See Gote's attack along the seventh file.","figures":[{"id":"2-1","marks":{"boxes":["7d"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}},{"id":"lesson-fujii-vs-kyusen-3","title":"藤井システム対居飛車急戦：▲７四歩から大駒を捌く: ▲６五歩から大駒を捌く","titleEn":"Fujii System vs Static Rook quick attack: ▲7四歩 and settling the major pieces: Settle the major pieces starting with ▲6五歩","myStrategy":"lesson","opponentStrategy":"lesson","mySide":"sente","userSide":"sente","noEngine":true,"source":"この講座のために書き下ろした解説と局面です。\n参考: 藤井システムvs居飛車急戦の定跡 (https://shogi-joutatsu.com/archives/7513, All rights reserved)","goalFormation":"後手は△８九飛成と飛車を逃げました。▲１一角成と香を取る手は魅力的ですが、△２二銀で攻めが続きません。そこで▲８八飛と引いて飛車交換を迫るのが正着です。以後は大駒を打ち合う終盤戦ですが、美濃囲いの堅い先手が指しやすい形です。","root":{"id":"n54","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/9/PPPPPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7g7f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n55","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"3c3d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n56","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/pppppp1pp/6p2/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6g6f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n57","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/pppppp1pp/6p2/9/2PP5/PP2PPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL w - 1",