2/1psP5/5P2P/PPS1P1PP1/3RG1SK1/LN3G1NL w BPb 1","branches":[{"usi":"8e8f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n86","sfen":"ln3gsnl/4g1k2/p2p1p1pp/1rP1p1p2/2sP5/1p3P2P/PPS1P1PP1/3RG1SK1/LN3G1NL b BPb 1","branches":[{"usi":"8g8f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n87","sfen":"ln3gsnl/4g1k2/p2p1p1pp/1rP1p1p2/2sP5/1P3P2P/P1S1P1PP1/3RG1SK1/LN3G1NL w B2Pb 1","branches":[{"usi":"7e8f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n88","sfen":"ln3gsnl/4g1k2/p2p1p1pp/1rP1p1p2/3P5/1s3P2P/P1S1P1PP1/3RG1SK1/LN3G1NL b B2Pbp 1","branches":[{"usi":"7g8f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n89","sfen":"ln3gsnl/4g1k2/p2p1p1pp/1rP1p1p2/3P5/1S3P2P/P3P1PP1/3RG1SK1/LN3G1NL w BS2Pbp 1","branches":[{"usi":"8d8f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n90","sfen":"ln3gsnl/4g1k2/p2p1p1pp/2P1p1p2/3P5/1r3P2P/P3P1PP1/3RG1SK1/LN3G1NL b BS2Pbsp 1","branches":[{"usi":"B*7g","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n91","sfen":"ln3gsnl/4g1k2/p2p1p1pp/2P1p1p2/3P5/1r3P2P/P1B1P1PP1/3RG1SK1/LN3G1NL w S2Pbsp 1","branches":[{"usi":"8f8i+","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n92","sfen":"ln3gsnl/4g1k2/p2p1p1pp/2P1p1p2/3P5/5P2P/P1B1P1PP1/3RG1SK1/L+r3G1NL b S2Pbsnp 1","branches":[{"usi":"6h8h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n93","sfen":"ln3gsnl/4g1k2/p2p1p1pp/2P1p1p2/3P5/5P2P/P1B1P1PP1/1R2G1SK1/L+r3G1NL w S2Pbsnp 1","branches":[],"comment":"後手は△８九飛成と飛車を逃げました。▲１一角成と香を取る手は魅力的ですが、△２二銀で攻めが続きません。そこで▲８八飛と引いて飛車交換を迫るのが正着です。以後は大駒を打ち合う終盤戦ですが、美濃囲いの堅い先手が指しやすい形です。","commentEn":"Gote saves the rook with △8九飛成. Taking the lance with ▲1一角成 is attractive, but △2二銀 leaves Sente without a follow-up. The correct move is ▲8八飛, pulling the rook back to force a rook exchange. After that comes an endgame of dropping major pieces, in which the firm Mino makes Sente the more comfortable side.","figures":[{"id":"3-5","marks":{"last":"8h","arrows":["8h8i"]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"後手は△８六歩から一気に攻めてきます。飛車が走ってきたところで、▲７七角と打つのが急所です。この角は飛車と、遠く１一の香を同時にねらう両取りで、後手の攻めを受け止めます。","commentEn":"Gote attacks at once with △8六歩. The key is ▲7七角 once the rook arrives: the bishop forks the rook and, from afar, the lance on 1a, and halts Gote's attack.","figures":[{"id":"3-4","marks":{"last":"7g","arrows":["7g8f","7g1a"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"後手は△７七角成と角を換え、▲同銀に△７五銀と出ます。先手は囲いに入りきっていませんが、相手の攻めの切れ目に▲２八玉と美濃囲いへ入ります。入るタイミングを見つけるのが、急戦に対する藤井システムのコツです。","commentEn":"Gote exchanges bishops with △7七角成 and, after ▲同銀, comes out with △7五銀. Sente is not fully in the castle yet, but takes the pause in Gote's attack to enter the Mino with ▲2八玉. Finding that moment is the key to the Fujii System against a quick attack.","figures":[{"id":"3-3","marks":{"last":"2h","boxes":["2h","7e"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"後手は△８四飛と、７四の歩を狙って飛車を浮かせました。そこで先手は▲６五歩と突いて、角道を開けます。相手の攻めを逆手にとって、一気に大駒を捌く狙いです。","commentEn":"Gote floats the rook with △8四飛, aiming at the pawn on 7d. Sente opens the bishop line with ▲6五歩, intending to turn Gote's attack around and settle the major pieces at once.","figures":[{"id":"3-2","marks":{"last":"6e","arrows":["7g2b"]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"▲７四歩まで進んだ局面です。後手が△８四飛と飛車を浮いた場合の戦いを見ます。","commentEn":"The position after ▲7四歩. See the fight when Gote floats the rook with △8四飛.","figures":[{"id":"3-1","marks":{"last":"7d"}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}